@startuml
!include _style.iuml
hide empty description
top to bottom direction
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 60
state "已保存" as Saved
state "编辑中" as Editing
state "保存中" as Saving
state "保存失败" as Failed
[*] --> Saved : 创建／读取成功
Saved -right-> Editing : 用户输入\n／更新草稿批次
Editing : 持续输入／重置静默计时
Editing -right-> Saving : 静默满 1 秒或退出\n／提交当前快照
Saving : 新输入／更新待提交草稿
Saving -[norank]-> Saved : \n成功且当前批次已全部确认\n／更新 savedRevision
Saving -[norank]-> Editing : 成功且有后续编辑\n／更新版本、安排下一批
Saving -down-> Failed : 失败／保留草稿
Failed -[norank]-> Saving : 用户重试\n／提交当前快照
Failed -[norank]-> Editing : 继续编辑\n／更新草稿
@enduml
